<!--
  DarkFrame curated glyph. Original artwork.

  Authored as a glyph on transparency with no background of its own, so the icon engine can seat
  it on any of the six collection containers and apply that collection's glyph treatment. The
  tile, keyline and colour all come from the style at render time, never from this file.

  White is used as the authoring colour because the engine maps source luma onto the collection
  tint, so pure white lands exactly on the tint and interior shading is preserved.
-->
